<title>POLAND: BFK JULY NET RISES TO PLN 4.1 MLN.</title>
<headline>BFK JULY NET RISES TO PLN 4.1 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-08-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results July</p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p> JULY		     1997     1996</p>
<p> Net profit	     4.09 vs   2.82</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 6.50 vs   4.49</p>
<p> Operating profit     7.04 vs   5.52</p>
<p> Sales		   35.76 vs  32.83</p>
<p> JANUARY-JULY	   1997     1996</p>
<p> Net profit	    26.47 vs  15.38</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	42.18 vs  25.00</p>
<p> Operating profit    46.30 vs  29.93</p>
<p> Sales		  222.39 vs 202.43</p>
<p>Note. Full name of the Polish cable maker is Bydgoska Fabryka</p>
<p>Kabli SA.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
